>>> write ok {"path":"docs/architecture.md","content":"# Architecture\n\nThe tool reads a document, turns it into a tree, and renders the tree.\n\n1. `src/parse`: the lexer splits the input into tokens and the parser builds the tree.\n2. `src/render`: one renderer per output format (HTML, plain text).\n3. `src/store`: an in-memory cache in front of the on-disk store.\n4. `src/cli.ts`: argument parsing and wiring.\n\nData flows one way: cli → parse → render, with store used by parse for includes.\n"}
